      <h1 class="article-title">The Nicene Creed</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">325 / 381 AD</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">The definitive creed of the universal church on the Trinity and incarnation.</p>
      
      
      <div class="faith-doc-actions">
        
      </div>
    </div>
